### ======================================================================================
### Seed: פיתוח (2) has a departmental HR – Liat Shahar (10). The other departments have none → central HR (6).
### Until the AI (task 4.3), every new ticket goes to GENERAL right away: Status Assigned, ClassificationSource
### Fallback, Urgency null, AiStatus Skipped, DueAt = now + 72 hours (Medium), history New → Assigned by the system.

### Departments → פיתוח: "hrUser": { "id": 10, ... Liat }; the others "hrUser": null
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### New ticket of Noa → 201. GENERAL routes to central HR: the handler with the fewest unresolved tickets
### (Yael or Adi, a tie → the lower id). The log has: "Ticket {id} routed to department 6, handler ..
### (reason FixedDepartment, source Fallback)" – ids only.
