Authorization: Bearer {{staffAlon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Department manager: tickets of פיתוח's employees + tickets פיתוח handles
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?scope=department
Authorization: Bearer {{staffRon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Executive: the whole organization – overdue only (DueAt passed while New/Assigned/InProgress; WaitingForEmployee is paused)
