### ============ AI analysis for the handler (task 4.4) ============
### Uses the staffAlon / staffRon logins above. The first ticket of Alon's own list.
# @name aiTickets
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?scope=assigned
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAlon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### The analysis → 200 { processing: { status, errorCode, errorMessage, requestedAt, nextAttemptAt },
### analysis: { categoryCode, categoryName, categoryId, urgency, confidence, confidenceLevel, summary, missingInformation,
### suggestedSolution, verdict, disposition, applied, matchesCurrentClassification, redactedInput, ... } | null }
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{aiTickets.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/ai-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAlon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### The requester (Noa, the employee login) → 404 on her own ticket
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/149/ai-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### "נתח מחדש" → 202 { id, rowVersion, canView }; Ai:Enabled=false or the breaker open → 422 ai-unavailable;
### again within two minutes → 422 ai-analysis-in-progress (while it waits) or 429 ai-retry-too-soon (Retry-After)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{aiTickets.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/ai-analysis/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAlon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Ron (department manager) sees the analysis, but may not retry → 403 ai-retry-not-allowed
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{aiTickets.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/ai-analysis/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{staffRon.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ============ AI evaluation (development only, not in the spec) – every call goes to OpenAI and costs money ============
### Uses the loginAdmin request above (Yael – Admin). The requester for name redaction is the signed-in user.

### One text → redactedText (exactly what was sent), analysis, verdict, decision, tokens, duration. Nothing is saved.
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/dev/ai/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "שכחתי להחתים", "text": "אתמול שכחתי להחתים כניסה. אלון ביטון אמר לפנות אליכם, הטלפון שלי 052-7654321" }

### Empty text → 400 on text (no OpenAI call)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/dev/ai/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "  " }

### The whole set (Tests/AiEvaluation/ai-evaluation-set.json), one case after the other → the report.
### ~30 calls: ask before running (docs/ai-evaluation.md).
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/dev/ai/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
